  + [P5-S06] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [P5-S07] is requires deeper reasoning

  = must: keep checkpoint nonauthority, SOP interrupt semantics, human judgment handoff, dependency posture, graph adapter activation, and downstream gates under deeper reasoning
  = must: treat bounded proof trace fixture planning as Spark-suitable only after graph state, node mapping, and interrupt contracts are accepted and stable

